    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Bodies</strong> is a charming puzzle game with a ghostly twist. In a world where nothing is as it once was, you take on the role of a ghost searching for your missing friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue them, you'll need to solve puzzles, overcome obstacles, and rely on a special ability: possessing lifeless bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooky Bodies offers a relaxed puzzle experience for players of all ages and the whole family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/0786c6636d16f4f438704c7bb104f1ca.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls, fences, and other obstacles often block your path in human form. In those moments, it's important to find and cleverly use traps to leave your physical body behind and become a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost, you can float through most physical barriers and explore the world in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/1a3141cf4ad9b59296e908a3bea5c7bb.poster.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/1a3141cf4ad9b59296e908a3bea5c7bb.webm?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/1a3141cf4ad9b59296e908a3bea5c7bb.mp4?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/e94c6aeb3710937fe21a9ee5b7eb73e0.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost, however, your ability to interact with the environment is limited. So keep a close eye on your surroundings and look for lifeless bodies. Slip into them and bring them back to life to progress through the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, only in human form can you complete levels or influence the physical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/d6d96c84bdbc25389d6af89a697f69c8.poster.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/d6d96c84bdbc25389d6af89a697f69c8.webm?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/d6d96c84bdbc25389d6af89a697f69c8.mp4?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/31adb804f95bea188415c10488e42591.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Spooky Bodies, you\u2019ll encounter a variety of objects you can interact with. Use your human form to open doors, trigger pressure plates, push crates, or rotate a crossbow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost, you can float through most obstacles with ease. But even in your spectral form, there are a few special objects waiting to be discovered and possessed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/83c9ef783d6358f9ab69066247c25fa9.poster.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/83c9ef783d6358f9ab69066247c25fa9.webm?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/83c9ef783d6358f9ab69066247c25fa9.mp4?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Bodies</strong> is a charming puzzle game with a ghostly twist. In a world where nothing is as it once was, you take on the role of a ghost searching for your missing friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue them, you'll need to solve puzzles, overcome obstacles, and rely on a special ability: possessing lifeless bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooky Bodies offers a relaxed puzzle experience for players of all ages and the whole family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/0786c6636d16f4f438704c7bb104f1ca.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls, fences, and other obstacles often block your path in human form. In those moments, it's important to find and cleverly use traps to leave your physical body behind and become a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost, you can float through most physical barriers and explore the world in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/1a3141cf4ad9b59296e908a3bea5c7bb.poster.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/1a3141cf4ad9b59296e908a3bea5c7bb.webm?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/1a3141cf4ad9b59296e908a3bea5c7bb.mp4?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/e94c6aeb3710937fe21a9ee5b7eb73e0.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost, however, your ability to interact with the environment is limited. So keep a close eye on your surroundings and look for lifeless bodies. Slip into them and bring them back to life to progress through the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, only in human form can you complete levels or influence the physical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/d6d96c84bdbc25389d6af89a697f69c8.poster.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/d6d96c84bdbc25389d6af89a697f69c8.webm?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/d6d96c84bdbc25389d6af89a697f69c8.mp4?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/31adb804f95bea188415c10488e42591.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Spooky Bodies, you\u2019ll encounter a variety of objects you can interact with. Use your human form to open doors, trigger pressure plates, push crates, or rotate a crossbow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a ghost, you can float through most obstacles with ease. But even in your spectral form, there are a few special objects waiting to be discovered and possessed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/83c9ef783d6358f9ab69066247c25fa9.poster.avif?t=1753990285\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/83c9ef783d6358f9ab69066247c25fa9.webm?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711220/extras/83c9ef783d6358f9ab69066247c25fa9.mp4?t=1753990285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
